# BOND Security

- Auth: httpOnly Secure SameSite=Lax session cookie → server session row.
- Ban `localStorage` / `sessionStorage` for auth, balances, subscriptions.
- Secrets only via env / Secret Manager. Never commit keys or paste into source.
- Every mutation resolves `orgId` from session; reject cross-tenant IDs.
- Validate amounts, vault IDs, addresses with Zod before IXS/AgentKit calls.
- CSRF middleware required on server functions.
- Hard errors when IXS/CDP/SERV/DB fail — no synthetic success payloads.
- Do not claim the system is unhackable; harden and document residual risk.
